<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The same approach is applied to vertical and diagonal winning threats, with corresponding functions for each.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Block Threats</h5>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following strategy detects and block potential horizontal red threats.</p>
</div>
